ns 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 66% of normal in November to December and 136% in April to May. So far in 2026 it shows 70% in March to April. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 19388 at 61%.</p>"}
